{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b52a7871aa31fdd52969d701ebc1c26394a6b3875afcb2f0fd6ea46c9c0e36c7", "ja": "（ひなたの地元、北海道でのライブは、\n大入り満員！　温かい拍手の中、幕を閉じた）", "zh": "（在日向的家乡北海道举行的演唱会座无虚席！\n在温暖的掌声中落下了帷幕。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "191ef70d73704c2869c5bb7f83221d2809d83d1956628a4f69bb7777f749202c", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさんです。\nあたし、ちゃんと歌えてたかねぇ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n我刚才唱得还算不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "3b3380f7c66d7d43b86b067119911246b8023457b05a19eebf6b8cb4806a66c7", "ja": "失敗は、しなかったと思うんだけども……。", "zh": "我觉得应该是没有失误啦，不过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "169398c92dde0a1c9264a318d63769ff678fca079eeab739ac07e0c52d360ca4", "ja": "失敗どころか、大成功だよ！\n客席の拍手が、なによりの証拠じゃないか。", "zh": "何止没失败，是大获成功啊！\n观众席上的掌声，不就是最好的证明吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "4690fa631de9bcf2f6ecb7d05be7ea4230dcbe3c7a619f4d0a160753462ebcc3", "ja": "えへへ、それならよかったよぉ。\nそっか……あたし、ちゃんとできたんだねぇ。", "zh": "诶嘿嘿，那就太好了呀。\n这样啊……我确实好好完成了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1881622dac915a1db32af1f67c577de771e79f3453fe7af2f01522bbf532595a", "ja": "ひなた？　どうしたんだ、ボーッとして。", "zh": "日向？怎么了，发什么呆呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "bd7183dce75a7b9e50d1321a298b2192341512d24e94c5b836beb415b6ae8743", "ja": "あ、ううん……。もしかしたらこのステージに、\nばあちゃんも立ったのかもって、思ったもんだから。", "zh": "啊，没什么……只是想着，说不定奶奶也曾站上过这个舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b7d553f25e5d0dd731fd4f8bee2cb144f3006efb32ef75c337dc93f761a13810", "ja": "ひなたの、おばあさんが？", "zh": "是小日向的祖母吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "53ac2d10437987f4ba1150fdc24ff864e5e564ecaeb42eed74204af56cb6ba48", "ja": "うん。ばあちゃんね、歌手だったんだわ。\n小さい頃から、色んな話を聞かせてくれたよぉ。", "zh": "嗯。我奶奶以前是歌手呢。\n从我小时候起，她就经常给我讲各种各样的故事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "714048e91e1a7cf44b15b66bd39f897286e45128faaca00a0753248ed8d83502", "ja": "ばあちゃんの声、すっごく綺麗でねぇ。\nあたしも真似して、いっぱい歌ったもんだよぉ。", "zh": "奶奶的声音特别好听呢。\n我也学着她的样子，唱了好多歌哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1011_p", "source_sha256": "402062592b54e99d7a485b622fbb4246a24dbfd9b393301d53ec4111546f68cb", "ja": "なるほど、そうだったんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "6a867996d9c3cfae2123461322462087821260b644e86dc7d389b860f09c2319", "ja": "うん。歌手はもう引退してしまったけど……。\nばあちゃんは今でも、なまらカッコいいんさ！", "zh": "嗯。虽然奶奶已经不再唱歌了……但她现在还是帅得不得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "a5b8463cfa1435aa82ed157124d7830fd84abe3b919c139fabcc595d4972971d", "ja": "本当に本当に、優しい人でねぇ。\nみんなを、いつも笑顔にしてくれるんだわ。", "zh": "真的是一个非常非常温柔的人呢。\n总是能让大家露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "517aa075f21f2687073621c1e6256f7ec8ead4e0ac2ae5315a9e04175200b9d1", "ja": "{$P$}、あたしもなれっかなぁ？\nばあちゃんみたいな、カッコいい人に。", "zh": "{$P$}，我也能成为那样的人吗？成为像奶奶一样帅气的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9d8f77e175b9dab7833d4ee4df2ade6a9eb2e466a663b929bfbf8b3fae93f31c", "ja": "ああ、なれると思うよ。\n今日のひなた、カッコよかったぞ。", "zh": "啊，我觉得你一定能成为那样的人。\n今天的日向，很帅气哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "9add800198538de0b6e704464cdc62bef76e19819ced6d1e86cd9fe197a11d35", "ja": "ええっ、ほ、本当かい？　どの辺が、そう思ったん\nだろか……必死だっただけだと思うんだけど。", "zh": "诶？真、真的吗？你是从哪一点看出来的……我只是拼命努力了而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8969effe361c1accf3649549953100f3634c8f32b186ff98e0ca0254e06258c6", "ja": "みんなの笑顔のために\n必死になれるのは、すごくカッコいいと思うぞ。", "zh": "为了大家的笑容拼尽全力，我觉得真的很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1018_p", "source_sha256": "27783cbf6da8a051658ac0dda938720c12189a0dcbacf86bf177b1966d5ca4d8", "ja": "ひなたも、おばあさんのそういう姿勢を、\nカッコいいと思ったんじゃないか？", "zh": "ひなた也觉得奶奶那样的态度很帅气吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "8687e4a9ae6a88dc81b3434a34c7dcddb48b72346c00675a3e82324642612b24", "ja": "{$P$}……うん、うん！\nそうだねぇ、本当にそうだわ。", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯，嗯！\n是啊，确实是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe64d49e7be64981ea1159d8d17712d0881f697cd2584fbbf5c20c3450790e7e", "ja": "ありがとねぇ、{$P$}。\nあたし、なまら嬉しいべさ！　えへへ……。", "zh": "谢谢你呀，{$P$}。\n我真的超级高兴呢！嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0204_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "d2ad2ea879b343788f00094d8f80b8f75ee8d0f4c2608b08e9ed7239bf99e0b7", "ja": "あたし、もっと頑張って、うんとカッコよくなるから。\nこれからも、見ててねぇ！", "zh": "我会更加努力，变得超级帅气。\n今后也要一直看着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
